<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended sharply higher in heavy trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 179.01 points to 6962.03.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 9.93 to 413.62.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.99.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 2091 to 527.</p>
<p>Volume was 547,666,310 compared with 402,414,970 on Monday.</p>
